      "body": "Thanks for your interest in SGLang. This account opened 16 PRs in about eight hours, across unrelated subsystems (attention backends, speculative decoding, diffusion loading, scheduler IPC, KV-cache compression, docs), including two PRs for the same change (#44073 and #44117, both for #28808) and a fix for #43929 that is already on main. We can't review contributions at this volume, so we are closing the ones still open. If you want to pursue one, please pick a single change, verify it on a real run (a repro, a test, or numbers), and open a fresh PR.",
